**Notes on the picks**
- **Parent and Tot:** The gym's Fall 2026 schedule PDF lists several 30-minute slots across the week. I couldn't reliably match each time to its day from how the PDF was laid out, so I left out specific days and times. No price was posted on the class page.
- **Pre-school Drop In:** The drop-in page still shows last year's date range (Oct 9 to June 26, 2026). The Fall 2026 schedule PDF does list the $15 preschool drop-in. This pick is therefore a little less certain than the first.
- **Tiny Dancers:** This is a dance class, not gymnastics. It is the town's parent-participation class for toddlers. The Fall 2026 dance schedule is on the town's page, but the snippet I read didn't include the day, time, dates or fee.
- **Cartwheels Gym Centre:** Its site mentions "Music Programming for Littles." It didn't give an age or schedule for toddlers, so I left it out.
